{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:56:24+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:56:24+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"MARR S.p.A.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Food Distribution","country":"Italy","city":"Rimini","website":"https://www.marr.it","employees":2337,"summary":"MARR S.p.A. engages in marketing and distribution of fresh, dried, and frozen food products for catering in Italy, the European Union, and internationally. It offers meat products, such as beef, sheep, pork, poultry, and rabbit families products; seafood products, including fresh and frozen seafood products; grocery products; cured meats and cheeses; and wine and beverages, such as liqueurs, bitters, grappa, classic and craft beers, drinks, which include juices, soft drinks, infusions, and tea. The company also provides nonfood products, such as disposable and consumable products, as well as cleaning and hygiene products and products for delivery and take away; and offers kitchens products to furnishing accessories for the restaurant hall, bedrooms, and services for the maintenance of public premises. In addition, it offers commercial consultancy and services, and digital solutions. It serves food products to bars and fast food outlets. MARR S.p.A. was incorporated in 1972 and is headquartered in Rimini, Italy. MARR S.p.A. is a subsidiary of Cremonini S.p.A.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"MARR S.p.A. s’occupe de la commercialisation et de la distribution de produits alimentaires frais, séchés et congelés pour la restauration en Italie, dans l’Union européenne et à l’international. Il offre des produits de viande, tels que le bœuf, les moutons, le porc, la volaille et les produits des familles de lapins; produits de la mer, y compris les produits de la mer frais et congelés; produits d'épicerie; charcuterie et fromages; et le vin et les boissons, tels que les liqueurs, les amers, la grappa, les bières classiques et artisanales, les boissons, y compris les jus, les boissons gazeuses, les infusions et le thé. La société fournit également des produits non alimentaires, tels que des produits jetables et consommables, ainsi que des produits de nettoyage et d'hygiène et des produits pour la livraison et l'enlèvement; et offre des produits de cuisine aux accessoires d'ameublement pour la salle de restaurant, aux chambres et aux services pour l'entretien des lieux publics."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":325574144,"shares_outstanding":62610417,"trailing_pe":14.857142,"forward_pe":9.446473,"price_to_book":1.0945064,"ev_to_ebitda":10.614,"ev_to_revenue":0.329,"dividend_yield":0.09,"payout_ratio":1.3428999,"beta_yahoo":0.888},"targets":{"current_price":5.2,"mean":8.13333,"median":7.15,"high":13.6,"low":5.6,"n_analysts":6,"reco_mean":2.66667,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-13"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":668000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.5042,"institutions_pct":0.20525,"institutions_float_pct":0.41397,"institutions_n":50,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"Fidelity Rutland Square TRT II-Strategic Advisers U.S. Total Stock Fd.","pct":0.0074,"shares":495000,"value":2573999,"date":"2025-07-31","chg":1.0},{"name":"AIM Fd.s Group -Invesco EQV Intl Small Company Fd.","pct":0.0069,"shares":462128,"value":2403065,"date":"2025-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0061000003,"shares":409075,"value":2127189,"date":"2025-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Fidelity Puritan Trust-Fidelity Series Intrinsic Opportunities Fund","pct":0.0061000003,"shares":406500,"value":2113799,"date":"2025-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0042,"shares":276133,"value":1435891,"date":"2025-07-31","chg":0.0124},{"name":"VANGUARD 